cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this dataset or pipeline, please cite it.
title: "Galen Corpus Terminology Density Map"
type: dataset
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-07-25"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21561964"
authors:
  - family-names: Pepperman
    given-names: William
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Montblanctech/Galen"
abstract: >
  A digital-availability census of the Galenic Greek corpus in First1KGreek
  (103 editions / 97 works), and the pipeline extending it into a terminology
  density map that flags lemmas statistically overused in the medical subcorpus
  relative to a non-Galen reference corpus and thinly glossed in LSJ. Data
  products are CC-BY-4.0; the accompanying pipeline code is MIT.
keywords:
  - Galen
  - Ancient Greek
  - terminology
  - digital humanities
  - corpus linguistics
